WEBVTT

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.500
#07 Ah! Vous dirai-je, Mer

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.860
What are you looking at?

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:16.990
Sakura.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.700
At this.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:27.500
KAMITOBA BEACH RESORT

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.160
Kamitoba Beach Resort?

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:25.200
It's a new leisure resort that just opened.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.500
Sakura, do you know what the "sea" is?

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:30.920
Are you talking about those huge puddles
you read about in books?

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.210
Yes, those.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:38.340
The cutting edge leisure resort
that reproduces the "sea" from books.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.180
That's the Kamitoba Beach Resort!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.140
I see. You want to go?

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:52.060
Yes, but the tickets are so expensive,
I can't afford one with my buildcash balance.

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.810
Then, I'll take you.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:54.320
What?

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.280
We have tomorrow off anyway.
We can ask Teruto too.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:58.780
But...

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:04.240
No worries. I'm making up for the trouble
you had to go through at Professor Keisen's.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:05.830
But that's...

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:09.750
What's wrong?
You won't accept my thanks, Hiyori?

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.960
Of course I can.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.210
Then, it's settled.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.000
Well? Looking forward to it?

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.630
Sakura!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.300
I love you.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.650
<i>Your special body...</i>

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.490
<i>...is a valuable test subject.</i>

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.170
I am...

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.130
...imperfect.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.350
This place is booming.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.770
I'm thrilled. You're amazing, Sakura.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.480
IDOL LIVE CONCERT

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.230
Is something the matter?

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.530
There's a swimsuit event for idols.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.860
Oh? Do you think there'll be famous people?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.700
Don't ask me.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.660
I wouldn't know about those things.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.540
Actually, you're pretty and have such a nice body.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.500
You could be a swimsuit idol yourself, don't you think?

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.500
Don't be ridiculous.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.210
Huh? Master, what do you think?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.420
The only thing I'm interested in is the King...

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.890
The King and bread, am I right?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.180
Why not get one?

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.270
Hiyori. Come with me.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.140
Copy that.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.480
Isn't this girl adorable?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.230
Who?

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.070
Who's cuter, this girl or you?

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.030
I'd say this girl.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.820
Since she's an idol.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:09.870
See you.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.200
Look closer, will you?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:12.410
Huh?

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.210
It annoys me when people blow me off.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.460
I didn't exactly...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.580
It looks like you can't be bothered.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.960
I told you, it's not like...

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.250
You should really stop acting like that.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.970
People will think you're mean.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.260
What's her problem?

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.060
Could she be...

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:44.530
The link between our unique system
and scout lens will stimulate your five senses.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:52.240
We'll coat you with our new treatment mist,
so you'll be in no danger of drowning.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:56.250
Needless to say,
you'll be able to play Build-Divide as well.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:03.670
The cutting edge leisure resort
that reproduces the "sea" from books.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.840
That's the Kamitoba Beach Resort!

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.680
Wow!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.680
So this is the sea.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.390
It's the sea. The sea, the sea!

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.480
Hurry, let's go, Sakura.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.940
Oh, is that you, Ms. Banka?

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.020
Ms. Minaguchi.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.980
You two are here too?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.660
You're Ms. Munenashi from the middle school, right?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:34.370
I AM HIYORI MUNENASHI

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.660
Would you not call me by my last name, please?

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.370
What? Why not?

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.750
Ms. Minaguchi, are you about to leave?

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.000
Yes, I've been here since early morning.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.790
It's so mind-blowing here.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.840
You two be sure to have a good time, okay?

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:50.430
Thank you very much. Let's go, Hiyori.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:54.100
Neo Kyoto, where the disparity is astounding.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.770
Master.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:04.270
Your outfit. Isn't it hot?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:08.860
Yes, it's hot. But this is my path.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.740
That's my Master. Ultra stoic.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.070
What in the world.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.450
Sakura. You...

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.460
What?

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.960
So you do have a neck.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:27.250
Of course I do.
Excuse me for being sensitive to the cold.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.220
Let's jump into the sea.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:37.010
I can't control my excitement.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.020
Let's go!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.570
Woo!

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.570
Hey!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:01.460
Huh?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.580
Three, two...

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.290
One!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.690
The sea rules.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.610
Even though it's salty.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.320
Who knew it'd be made of salt water?

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:33.820
If it was sweet, it would have been perfect.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:34.610
True.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.700
The perfect sea might very well be sweet.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.050
Sorry. It's starting to get chilly.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.340
I'm going to head back to our parasol.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.130
Sure.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.550
Are you okay?

00:08:56.550 --> 00:09:00.180
I'm fine. Hiyori, would you look after Teruto for me?

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.180
He'll get lost if you take your eyes off him.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.270
Just leave it to me.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.570
It's cold.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.660
It feels warmer over here.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.500
A sweet sea, huh?

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:43.680
PEAR MIHARU

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.980
Everyone. Thank you for coming!

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:56.070
I'm Pear Miharu, or Pearmi.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:59.530
I hope you'll stay and have fun with me today!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.500
Thank you everyone!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.750
She's just a pretty face and nothing else.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.380
Pearmi!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:54.750
Who was that?

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.050
Start looking!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:02.260
Please drop by the photo shoot later, okay?

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.970
Au revoir.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:09.480
People say the meanest things. Right, Master?

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.230
Huh?

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.730
Master?

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:24.700
KAMITOBA BEACH RESORT
LIMITED EDITION TROPICAL JUICE

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.700
Limited edition tropical juice?

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:27.830
Those two should be coming back soon.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.870
So annoying.
Why does he have to come and wreck things?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.380
That pesky hater.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.170
Seriously, he's beyond creepy!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:42.300
I want to thank her today,
so maybe I'll buy her a juice.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:46.640
Making an idol buy her own juice.
Is this staff out of their minds?

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.270
I thought so. This idol...

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.060
That was her earlier, right?

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.230
I wonder why she was so huffy?

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.070
Plus I had to run into that awful girl earlier.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.650
Could this day get any worse?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.740
- May I have the limited edition tropical juice, please?
- May I have the limited edition tropical juice, please?

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:01.280
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.450
You're that girl from before.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:05.950
You're the awful girl.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.290
What did I ever do to you?

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:13.920
You're looking down on me without even realizing it.
That bothers me.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.090
Excuse me.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:22.170
Sorry to interrupt,
but the limited edition tropical juice...

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.390
LIMITED EDITION TROPICAL JUICE

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.390
There's only one left.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.350
You order something else.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:32.940
I would have been fine with that,
but with the way you're acting, I won't.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.440
So what are we going to do?

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.400
You know there's only one way.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.360
Oh? Fine by me.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.570
Call. Iora.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.620
Call. Margulis.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.720
- Build-Divide.
- Build-Divide.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.890
Pearmi onstage.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:09.510
Repeat Waiter. Accept.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.520
If you want juice so bad, take hold of this.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.360
Hard pass. There!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:27.620
I offered you a feast. You've made Pearmi sad.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.370
Even still...

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.370
Here, have seconds.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.160
Recovery ability.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.960
Picking fights with me...

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:37.000
You really are a pain.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.000
Who are you to talk?

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.170
Just because someone said you could be an idol,
you became all full of yourself, no?

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:53.720
Is it an idol's job to trample all over
other people's feelings?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.520
Of course not. Idols...

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.520
We're cute and cheerful.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:13:59.940
Everyone loves us.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.270
Like angels, got it?

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.780
Not bad.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.160
But I'm getting momentum.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:13.830
Annihilate all that confronts you. Accept.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.920
Duo Sirius Iora.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.840
Territory. Build Arise.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.090
Heavy Artillery Base Vulbabylon.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.930
Activating Iora's ability.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.720
Scout Three.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.680
Using Iora to attack Repeat Waiter.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:38.230
Using the ability to send a card from
the top of my deck to the Cemetery.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.900
Since it's a Command Card, I can keep playing.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:45.190
Using Command to destroy Concierge.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:49.320
Also in the battle, destroy Waiter.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:54.620
Now you've done it.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.620
What is that look for?

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:00.960
What...

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:01.920
What...

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.130
What is your problem?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.710
What did I ever do to you?

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.720
That girl could never make it as an idol.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.510
I mean she even looks mean.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.760
She can't do anything.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.350
She'll never have fans.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:17.140
It's not my fault.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.850
Charm them with your tainted beauty.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:27.360
Accept. Margulis, Evil Eye Demon King.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.200
Territory. Build Arise.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.370
Miasmic Palace of Doom.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.080
When it opens, activate ability.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.750
Come out from the Cemetery.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.000
Grudge Watcher.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.670
How creepy.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.920
Using Grudge Watcher to attack Frida.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.590
Frida's power is seven thousand.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.350
Using a unit with only four thousand power is suicidal.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.730
Activate ability.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:03.520
Destroy all opponents with less than six Cost.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:10.440
That grudge is what cursed Frida to her death.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.780
Really poor taste.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:17.790
Oh. Not again.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.540
<i>Such poor taste.</i>

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.460
<i>No talent. No purpose.</i>

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:30.050
<i>That's all everyone ever says about me.</i>

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.380
<i>What's up with that?</i>

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:36.100
<i>Don't you know just how much I want...</i>

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.770
Like you're all so high and mighty.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.730
Don't you dare reject me when I try so hard!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.110
Miss.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.530
Au revoir.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.820
Margulis.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.330
End Phase.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.450
Miasma of Margulis...

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.620
...will consume you.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:05.330
As long as this unit is attacking...

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:08.040
My opponent's front life will be sent to the Cemetery.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:12.010
Now you're down to two lives.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.050
Accept.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.680
Nadiya, Brahmadatta. End of turn.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.020
Just give up already. You have no chance.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.600
Haven't you noticed?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.940
As of now, all you can spout is resentment and toxicity.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.070
You couldn't look less like an angel.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:35.950
Shut up! You know nothing about idols,
so don't talk like you know.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:40.280
Do you know how much I've sacrificed?

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.290
Sacrificed...

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:44.790
You're so annoying. I'm ending this now.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.870
Accept. Xenos.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:47.920
I'm not done.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.630
Quick Timing. Command. Surprise Attack.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.590
Using my Territory's ability to copy.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.550
Forcing Margulis and Bestola to rest.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.010
Now I can't launch my attacks.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.470
Stop struggling when it's futile.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:06.020
Is it futile? I can see my path to victory.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.520
Accept.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.780
Durandal Zophia.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:23.870
Using Zophia's ability to launch
the Command Beast King's Rage.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.000
Using my Territory ability to copy.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.960
Sending Zophia into a Command Battle
against Xenos and Margulis.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.460
Like a flash.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.050
What did you mean by "sacrifice"?

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:40.640
Who made you choose a path
that you had to sacrifice for?

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:46.350
I know someone who refuses to lose sight of his path.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:48.560
Even though he's forgotten his past.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:55.150
Now, I'm about to...

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.530
Even if I'm imperfect...

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.950
At least I can say this.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.330
If I just keep feeling sorry for myself...

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.620
I'll never be perfect.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:19.590
I see.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:27.140
I chose this for myself.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:37.940
Hey.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.530
Oh. I lost.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:45.490
You can have that limited edition tropical juice.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.620
I don't really...

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.040
Oh. What's your name?

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:51.710
I'm Sakura.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:52.420
I see.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.380
I guess Pearmi was a bad girl.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:59.510
I'll be good from now on,
so please don't hate me, Sakura.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:02.130
Then, au revoir.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.390
A bad girl...

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:08.810
Excuse me.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.640
The tropical juice...

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.270
Oh.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:15.110
I'm going to pass.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.940
All right...

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.080
What's his deal?

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.620
It's that guy from before.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.000
Wait, everyone.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.500
What do you want?

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.210
Mister, do you hate Pearmi?

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:42.090
Huh? Yes, I hate you. Sure I do.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:48.390
Understood. But there's one thing
I want you to remember.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:56.520
Pearmi loves you very much, Mister.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:07.660
What an angel!

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:07.990
Pearmi!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:08.990
No, she's a goddess!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.370
Sakura!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.630
I can explain. I can explain.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:29.470
<i>Ladies and gentlemen, we have a lost child.</i>

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:32.520
LOST PERSON
TERUTO KURABE

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.020
<i>Teruto Kurabe from Sanjo Ohashi.</i>

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.100
That directionally challenged moron.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>He's searching for his guardians.</i>

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.980
You were counting on me. I'm so sorry.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:41.610
<i>If this is you, please come to the Lost Child Center.</i>

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.230
Please come again.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.070
MIKAZUKI STORE

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:45.910
<i>Repeat, ladies and gentlemen.</i>

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:47.700
<i>We have a lost child.</i>

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:53.000
<i>Teruto Kurabe from Sanjo Ohashi.</i>

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:55.920
<i>He's searching for his guardians.</i>

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.460
Teruto?

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:59.920
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:31.890
Welcome, Teruto.

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:34.850
I feel certain that I hate Kikka.

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:38.770
I want to remember the real you.

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.940
#08 Buried Memories
